arker shades in its forms.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901224157\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019427/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.328      1 Template:Ore\n100.00%   42.328      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3280-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901224157 and revision id 15340. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Ores"],"links":[{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Iron","exists":true},{"title":"Sandslate","exists":true},{"title":"Tin","exists":true},{"title":"Zinc","exists":true}],"images":["Silver_Ore.png","Silver_Refined.png","Silver_Bar.png"]}
